Not entirely.  As before, with regard to the private site, all we are
discussing, for the most part, is the contractual right to post from
that site.  With regard to the state-run site, we are discussing only
that plus the general ban on content-oriented censorship.

> and unless any of you are a federal judge, I don't think you're in a
